Template: paperless-ngx/enable-imagemagick-pdf
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Enable ImageMagick PDF processing for paperless-ngx?
 Many distributions disable ImageMagick PDF decoding by default because PDFs can
 contain malware. If enabled, paperless-ngx may use ImageMagick for operations
 such as thumbnail generation. If disabled, paperless-ngx will fall back to
 Ghostscript.
